# Graphite Black Color Palette

All UI code must use these exact hex values. No exceptions.

## Backgrounds
- bg_app: #060606
- bg_shell: #0B0B0C
- bg_panel: #101112
- bg_card: #151617
- bg_card_hover: #1B1D1F
- bg_card_active: #202326
- bg_input: #121314
- bg_popup: #17191B

## Borders
- border_soft: #232629
- border_default: #2C3034
- border_strong: #3A3F45

## Text
- text_primary: #F2F2F2
- text_secondary: #C9CDD2
- text_muted: #8A9097
- text_disabled: #62686F

## Status Colors (only for state meaning)
- success: #4E7F5F / success_text: #8FC7A1 / success_bg: #162019
- warning: #9A6B36 / warning_text: #D8A46B / warning_bg: #211A14
- danger: #8B4A4A / danger_text: #D68E8E / danger_bg: #211616
- neutral_state: #5E666F / neutral_state_text: #A9B0B7 / neutral_state_bg: #181A1C

## Buttons
- primary_bg: #E7E9EC / primary_text: #111214 / primary_hover: #F1F2F4 / primary_pressed: #D7DBDF
- sidebar active indicator: #5B6168

## Forbidden
Never use: neon accents, blue focus rings, purple/cyan/brand-color CTA, colored tabs without state meaning.

## Rule: 85/10/5
- 85% black/gray/anthracite surfaces
- 10% lighter neutral contrast
- 5% status colors
